destroyed.text:
Throughout October 2026, the Defense Forces destroyed over 8,000 aerial targets; in addition, more than 43,000 tactical-level UAVs were neutralized, including:

▪️ 14 Kh-101 cruise missiles;
▪️ 11 Iskander-M/KN-23 ballistic missiles;
▪️ 12 Kalibr cruise missiles;
▪️ 7 Kh-59/69 guided air-launched missiles;
▪️ 8 Iskander-K cruise missiles;
▪️ 1 Zircon anti-ship missile;
▪️ 143 "Banderol" units;
▪️ 4,455 strike UAVs (Shahed-131/136 types, Gerbera, and "Parodiya" decoy drones);
▪️ 2,688 Shahed-238 strike UAVs;
▪️ 1,104 reconnaissance UAVs;
▪️ 809 "Lancet" UAVs.

sorties.text:
✈️ During October, Air Force aviation conducted over 1,200 sorties, including:

▪️ over 1,100 for fighter air cover;
▪️ approximately 70 for engaging targets and providing air support to ground troops.
